# RxJS Schedulers

- **Do not** default every Observable to `asyncScheduler`.
- Timed operators (`interval`, `timer`, `delay`, `debounceTime`, …) already use **`asyncScheduler`** by default.
- `observeOn(scheduler)` → when **notifications** are delivered.
- `subscribeOn(scheduler)` → when **subscription** starts (rarer).
- Prefer `scheduled(array, sch)` over ambiguous `of(...values, scheduler)`.

| Need | Scheduler |
|------|-----------|
| Default / yield to event loop | `asyncScheduler` |
| Microtask (after stack, before timers) | `asapScheduler` |
| Same-turn trampoline | `queueScheduler` |
| Visual updates | `animationFrameScheduler` |
| Sync | omit scheduler |

```js
// ✅ yield before UI after heavy sync map
heavy$.pipe(map(expensive), observeOn(asyncScheduler)).subscribe(updateUI);

// ❌ unnecessary double async
source$.pipe(observeOn(asyncScheduler), debounceTime(300), observeOn(asyncScheduler));
```
